<title>BELGIUM: Sofina H1 profit 2.47 bln Bfr vs 1.12 bln.</title>
<headline>Sofina H1 profit 2.47 bln Bfr vs 1.12 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996 (in</p>
<p>billions of Belgian francs, unless stated):</p>
<p>    Cons pre tax profit	 2.466  vs  1.118</p>
<p>    Cons current income	 1.058  vs  1.090</p>
<p>NOTE - Sofina SA is a Belgian holding company with interests in the energy, banking, distribution and services.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said results were boosted by capital gains on the sale of shares, notably in United Meridian Corp. and Xeikon NV.</p>
<p>Sofina said first half results were not representative of full year results, but that 1996's dividend should be at least equal to 1995's.</p>
<p>-- Nick Antonovics, Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6817, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
